> Source https://uximc.mms.tst.pgwcloud.net/FileTransfer/SearchFTPServerCredentials · viewport 1920×1080 CSS px @ dpr 1 · legacy built with jquery 3.7.1 + Kendo UI for jQuery (Provider portal) · target React 19
